%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-core-functions-replace (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  [ 7890, "a-c-2-d-f" ]
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/json
---
["123-456-7890" replace /.*-/ with(""), "abc123def" replace /[b13e]/ with("-")]
%%% output application/json
[
  "7890",
  "a-c-2-d-f"
]
